<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <title>Portal site | Fang.</title>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>

<body>
  <article class="portal-page">
    <header class="portal-header">
      <section class="site-warning" aria-labelledby="site-warning-title">
        <h2 id="site-warning-title">表現の警告</h2>
        
        <div class="site-rating">
          <p>本コンテンツはR-18G指定です。</p>
          <p>暴力・流血・虐待・自殺企図・精神的負荷の高い描写を含みます。</p>
          <p>18歳未満の方や、精神的な健康に不安のある方は閲覧をご遠慮ください。</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </header>

    <section class="portal-choices" aria-label="site entrances">
      <a class="portal-card portal-card--visual" href="/universe/" door-transition>
        <picture>
          <img
            class="portal-card__logo"
            src="/assets/FANG-visual.svg"
            alt="特殊能力の法則"
          >
        </picture>
        <span class="portal-card__title">特殊能力</span>
        <span class="portal-card__description">
          この世界の法則。
        </span>
      </a>

      <a class="portal-card portal-card--visual" href="/episodes/" door-transition>
        <picture>
          <img
            class="portal-card__logo"
            src="/assets/FANG-visual.svg"
            alt="Fang. 昭和、平成、令和 東京都 物理法則を超えた力が在る社会にて"
          >
        </picture>
        <span class="portal-card__title">エピソード</span>
        <span class="portal-card__description">
          特殊能力者達に起こった出来事。
        </span>
      </a>

      <a class="portal-card portal-card--visual" href="/photos/" door-transition>
        <picture>
          <img
            class="portal-card__logo"
            src="/assets/FANG-visual.svg"
            alt="イラスト"
          >
        </picture>
        <span class="portal-card__title">写真</span>
        <span class="portal-card__description">
          特殊能力者達の姿。
        </span>
      </a>

      <a class="portal-card portal-card--archive" href="/timeline/" wire-transition>
        <picture>
          <img
            class="portal-card__logo"
            src="/assets/FANG-audio.svg"
            alt="Fang. 昭和、平成、令和 東京都 物理法則を超えた力が在る社会にて"
          >
        </picture>
        <span class="portal-card__title">文書</span>
        <span class="portal-card__description">
          ある特殊能力者がみた世界。
        </span>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="portal-subnav" aria-labelledby="portal-subnav-title">
      <h2 id="portal-subnav-title">関連資料</h2>

      <nav class="portal-link-list" aria-label="related links">
      <a class="portal-link-item" href="/history/">
          <span class="portal-link-item__label">History</span>
          <span class="portal-link-item__title">現代史</span>
          <span class="portal-link-item__description">
            登場人物の経歴と、現実の歴史の併記
          </span>
        </a>

        <a class="portal-link-item" href="https://fang.booth.pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="portal-link-item__label">BOOTH</span>
          <span class="portal-link-item__title">頒布物</span>
          <span class="portal-link-item__description">
            本・グッズなどの頒布場所
          </span>
        </a>

        <a class="portal-link-item" href="/references/">
          <span class="portal-link-item__label">References</span>
          <span class="portal-link-item__title">参考文献</span>
          <span class="portal-link-item__description">
            Fang.制作のために参照した書籍・文献・公開資料
          </span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </section>
  </article>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <nav class="footer-policy-nav" aria-label="policy navigation">
      <a href="/policy/license/">ライセンス</a>
      <a href="/policy/commercial-use/">商用利用禁止</a>
      <a href="/policy/ai-use/">生成AI・機械学習への利用</a>
    </nav>

    <a class="footer-logo-link" href="https://object-official-site.web.app/">
      <picture>
        <img class="footer-logo object-logo" src="/assets/object._logo.svg" alt="Object.">
      </picture>
    </a>

    <small>
      Copyright since 2026
      <a class="ink" href="https://linktr.ee/notinkbutink">ink.</a>
      All Rights Reserved.
    </small>
  </footer>
</body>
<div class="door-transition-overlay" door-transition-overlay aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="wire-transition-overlay" wire-transition-overlay aria-hidden="true"></div>
<script src="/js/door-transition.js"></script>
<script src="/js/wire-transition.js"></script>
</html>